We can then send requests to the newly started service with any HTTP client:
Python Bash

  import  requests 
requests . post ( 
    "http://127.0.0.1:3000/classify" , 
    headers = { "content-type" :  "application/json" }, 
    data = "[5,4,3,2]" ) . text 

